   "originalText": "Core — FastAPI modular monolith\nSQLAlchemy 2.0 async · Pydantic v2\n\naccounts · tenants (replica)\ncatalog · inventory · procurement\nsales · pricing · customers\nfinance · orders · storefront API\nhr · sync · accounting · credit\nproduction · planning · workflow\npayroll · reporting\nintegrations: payment, fiscal, printers\noutbox table · internal API",
